  "question": {
    "text": "If the area of an equilateral triangle inscribed in the circle <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>27</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>sq</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>units</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then <math><mi>c</mi></math> is equal to:"
